# Every HTTP route AWS's own published API models say exists, for the services
# internal/aws signs for (botocore service-2.json, fetched without credentials).
# One line per operation: signing-name, method, request URI, operation.
# Routes whose URI is just "/" are omitted: for those services the operation is
# chosen by an Action field or an X-Amz-Target header, so the path proves nothing.
# Refresh: scripts/refresh-aws-routeops.sh
# 1499 routes across 44 service models covering 40 signing names
